          "text": "LEAK TIMELINE (all times UTC; T-0 = deployment order, 10:41)\nT-72h  Pacific Northwest contingency plan finalised\nT-68h  Agent 0x00 pre-positioned, Pacific Northwest\nT-48h  (D-2 10:38-11:25) ANOMALY: operations plan opened, 47 min, Crypto Lab terminal\nT-47h  ENTROPY coordination chatter begins\nT-24h  ENTROPY fully prepared for our response\nT-51m  (09:50) Deployment confirmed to ENTROPY (intercept)\nT-0    Four sites go live. They were already waiting.\n\nThe leak went out just before the 48-hour mark. Full planning access and a Crypto Lab terminal. Three names on the Director's list have that access. Two of them badge through the lab door: Cipher and Nightshade. Get the door logs.",
          "onPickup": { "setVariable": { "found_timeline": true } },
