                "text": "<%= rot13(base64_encode(backup_plain)) %>",
                "_comment": "PASS 4 (fix 12): the observation no longer names the two encodings; HaX's text and the CyberChef guide carry the hint. PASS 4 (fix 1): a print surface. With the kit, opening it from the inventory starts the dusting panel first ('Use normally' reads the file); fingerprint_collected:nightshade sets nightshade_print_lifted (agent_0x99). The print is on the gloss casing rather than the paper envelope: the kit's surfaces are glossy or textured plastic.",
