                "takeable": true,
                "readable": true,
                "observations": "A slim ENTROPY recruitment document. Page 7 is the one that matters.",
                "observationDisplay": "gameDisplay",
                "text": "ENTROPY -- INSIDER THREAT INITIATIVE\n'Deep State' Programme (fragment, p.7)\n\nIdeal candidates are not bought. They are convinced. Look inside intelligence agencies for the disillusioned -- those who have started to believe that defence is a delaying action against an outcome already decided.\n\nRecruit young. During training, before loyalty sets. Place them, then wait years. A convinced asset needs no handler and leaves no financial trail. They will act, when asked, because they believe it is right.\n\nCompensation: none. Belief is the payment.",
