              "takeable": true,
              "readable": true,
              "observations": "A packed holdall on the top shelf.",
              "observationDisplay": "gameDisplay",
              "text": "A packed holdall on the top shelf. Nothing in it is his.\n - A passport in a name you have never heard, with his photograph.\n - An e-ticket, one way, economy, to Helena, Montana, for the morning after Portland. Not used.\n - A change of clothes. No cash. No photographs.\n\nHe packed to leave nine days ago, and he is still at his desk.",
